<title>USA: Chesterfield County, Va., Health 6.00 pct in 2039.</title>
<headline>Chesterfield County, Va., Health 6.00 pct in 2039.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said Tuesday it priced $20.9 million of Health Center Commission for the County of Chesterfield, Va., mortgage revenue bonds GNMA collateralized Lucy Corr Nursing Home project, Series 1996, with a top yield of 6 percent in 2039.</p>
<p>   MOODY'S:    S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>DATED: 12/01/1996 FIRST COUPON: 6/01/1997   DUE:6/01 &amp; 12/01</p>
